The function is already a bare forwarder, so the only safe win is to keep it byte-identical; any inlining of the callee's storage would require assumptions about members not visible here.

```cpp
void FieldBase::SetUINT64ZValue(const FIT_UINT64Z value, const FIT_UINT8 fieldArrayIndex)
{
    SetUINT64Value(value, fieldArrayIndex);
}
```